    "description": "<p>This Charm allows the raksha to forge a Heart Grace from raw Essence and gossamer. Noble raksha with a Birth Background rating of 4 or higher begin life with this Charm, having shaped themselves into existence. Lesser raksha began existence as the possession of some other raksha, only later winning a Heart Grace, and therefore freedom, for themselves. The raksha can use this Charm to grant a Heart Grace to a minion but not a Creation-born.</p>",
